# Forge Knowledge

- Keep project facts in `projects/<slug>/knowledge/` before merging to `knowledge/`.
- Every fact/edge needs provenance (project, URL when available, confidence, epistemic class, review status).
- Never store recommendations/inferences as confirmed facts.
- Candidate patterns are unapproved; never call them standards/best practices.
- ≥2 distinct projects AND companies required for candidate auto-create; conflicts block promotion.
- Use stable IDs from `lib/knowledge/ids.ts`. Bump `KNOWLEDGE_SCHEMA_VERSION` on breaking changes.
- Rebuilds must preserve `knowledge/audit/`. Prefer idempotent ingest + `--dry-run`.
